// The banquet hall: the feast's great room. A high table runs down the middle, laid for more than will ever sit.
//
// Enter from the service stair onto the west gallery. Landings zigzag up the east side
// to the kitchens' door and, under the ceiling, the stair up to the long table.
// The supper room and its lounge are off the floor at the east end.
// A Favour waits on a shelf over the high table, for a good Lunge.
